===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|were}}, from {{inh|de|goh|werī}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*warīniz}}, derived from {{m|gem-pro|*warjaną}}, whence {{cog|de|wehren}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|weer}}.

